Blockers (must fix in 3.1):
- **B1** HTTP-to-self calls in storyboard/assets/assemble/auto-sync steps (`127.0.0.1:{STS_PORT}`) â€” replace with 
direct service calls.
- **B2** `STS_PORT` env var set inside a request handler (`pipeline/routes.py:280`) â€” never rely on it in workflow 
code.
