codex
Implemented step 3.6: live canvas states and the minimal execution panel.

Key additions:

- SSE-driven node statuses, sample-data markers, animated running edges, and post-run edge summaries.
- Run/Stop toolbar controls.
- Result Viewer output summaries.
- Current-run panel with node status, duration, errors, and selectable output JSON.
- “Open in Timeline Editor” when an editor project is produced.
- Execution state and terminal-record hydration in the Pinia store.
- Regression coverage in [liveExecution.test.js](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/frontend/src/features/workflow/__tests__/liveExecution.test.js).

Main files:

- [workflow.js](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/frontend/src/features/workflow/stores/workflow.js)
- [WorkflowPage.vue](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/frontend/src/features/workflow/views/WorkflowPage.vue)
- [ExecutionPanel.vue](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/frontend/src/features/workflow/components/ExecutionPanel.vue)
- [NodeCard.vue](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/frontend/src/features/workflow/components/NodeCard.vue)

Verification:

- Frontend: 74 tests passed.
- Backend: 103 tests and 38 subtests passed.
- Production frontend build passed.
- `git diff --check` passed.

The Phase 3 live end-to-end gate remains pending: the in-app browser was unavailable, so the Full Video run, Timeline Editor handoff, and actual FFmpeg export still require a manual smoke test with the development server and providers running.
